Package: ibus-libpinyin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         ibus (>= 1.2.0),
         libpinyin-data (>= 2.6)
Description: Intelligent Pinyin engine based on libpinyin for IBus
 ibus-libpinyin provides a Chinese Pinyin input method and a Chinese
 ZhuYin (Bopomofo) input method based on libpinyin for the IBus
 framework. It features offline voice input powered by ONNX Runtime
 and the Paraformer ASR model.
